
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-8.8806089e-05 -0.0068537021 -0.0341715) to (41.048089 40.633838 42.190171)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
